From 6de760e12df355ecaf1c8c336a2ee8163a0ce96d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 07:16:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Admin panel: day/night mode, calmer colors, mobile
 layouts

- Own admin palette (Apple-style): soft graphite night mode instead of
  pure black, off-white text, muted gold; light day mode on #F2F2F7.
  Toggle in the header, remembered per browser, defaults to device mode
- Phone: users and premium lists as tappable rows; physical cards as
  cards with all fields visible; 2-column KPI grids
- Badges no longer clip; chart axis uses 1.6M/400K; role descriptions
  match server checks; removed 'planned backup' placeholder

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X3fizJ3F3nvfvUZqdZamcq
